shCode/MR_5e65abb43fa24a31bb27de92c0209d21/6163fdc44d459a09ed8d5e9ae3265d94?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=867b05c0cff744d68efb109e241a4392&pipelineRunId=a5925d26f6b24fb89bd88e9d4044b0fe&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/opbase/package/554/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-24 11:28:58] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:25:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:28:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176859971,"discussion_id":"e1f13a08e37d9e6c0947d8816e2409ba126adc7f","body":"<div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">流水线 <a href=\"https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?projectId=300033&pipelineId=867b05c0cff744d68efb109e241a4392&pipelineRunId=a5925d26f6b24fb89bd88e9d4044b0fe&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode\">PR-pipeline_cann_opbase#1305</a>  [ commitID：23ce073c ] 已完成</div>\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:29:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:29:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176860976,"discussion_id":"37bc6e434940fd5d14b490438c20523af08d8630","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `LpNormV2` 算子在混合精度场景下的精度问题。改动集中在 `reduce_sch_aux_base.h` 文件中的 Reduce 调度辅助基类 `ReduceSchAuxBase`，主要涉及后处理阶段 MTE3 数据搬出时的对齐逻辑修正，确保在 LpNormV2 这类混合精度（如 fp16 输入、fp32 计算）场景下，reduce 结果通过 MTE3 拷贝输出时步长（stride）与 shape 正确对齐到最小数据类型的 UB Block 边界，避免因对齐不当导致的数据搬移错误进而引发精度偏差。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`PostReduce` 函数中的数据搬出对齐逻辑优化**：调整了 `newView.axis[1].srcStride` 和 `newShape.value[1]` 在 `Pattern::TailA` 分支下的计算方式，使用 `CeilAlign(outLen, UB_BLOCK / MIN_DTYPE_BYTES)` 统一对齐到最小数据类型块大小，而非直接使用原始 `outLen`，确保 MTE3 跳搬（stride copy）时数据布局正确\n- **移除/简化冗余的对齐计算或条件分支**：净减少 4 行代码（+7/-11），推测合并或删除了原先分散的对齐处理逻辑，使 `PostReduce` 中的对齐计算更加集中和一致\n- **`CopyOutGroup` 中对应保持一致的对齐策略**：`CopyOutGroup` 函数在 `Pattern::TailA` 分支中同样使用 `CeilAlign(outLen, UB_BLOCK / MIN_DTYPE_BYTES)` 设置 `newView.axis[1].srcStride`，与 `PostReduce` 保持行为一致\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:32:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:32:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176861266,"discussion_id":"75658a352841a0f33aa2bad601ae35d1892e527d","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n共发现 **2** 个问题，均为 P3（低严重度）：\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 0    |\n| P2     | 0    |\n| P3     | 2    |\n\n### 已审查文件\n\n- **`pkg_inc/op_common/atvoss/reduce/reduce_sch_aux_base.h`** — 2 个 P3 问题（冗余变量赋值 + 过时注释），核心逻辑修复正确。\n\n### 整体评价\n\n该 diff 的核心逻辑修复是正确的：将 `PostReduce` 中 `srcStride` 的判断条件从运行时的 `sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType)` 改为编译期的 `Pattern::TailA`，并与同文件中已有的 `CopyOutGroup` 函数保持一致。同时修复了旧代码中 `srcStride` 与 `newShape.value[1]` 在非 TailA 同精度场景下不一致的精度 bug（`srcStride = outLen` 但 `shape` 使用对齐值）。**风险较低**，建议合入前修复两个 P3 问题以提升代码整洁度和可维护性。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 2 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:17+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176861273,"discussion_id":"e77ecea1d7b95bccd4755f840ea2094606e1d110","body":"\uD83D\uDD35 **Low Priority**\n\n第 637 行注释：\n描述的是旧代码中 `sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType)` 运行时判断的逻辑。变更后代码改为编译期 `if constexpr (Pattern::TailA)` 判断，不再依赖混合精度条件。注释内容与代码实际判断条件不一致，可能误导后续维护者。\n\n**建议**：将注释更新为描述 TailA 模式需要 stride 对齐跳搬，例如改为：\"// TailA场景下MTE3搬出需要跳搬\"。\n\n```suggestion\n        // TailA场景下MTE3搬出需要跳搬(lp_norm_v2存在此场景)\n```\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T09:28:15+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":637,"end_new_line":637,"start_old_line":636,"end_old_line":636,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":176861275,"discussion_id":"793d3514779d47cc8fa73590d6e7559538b826f4","body":"\uD83D\uDD35 **Low Priority**\n\n变更后的代码中，`uint64_t minDtypeBlockAlign = Ops::Base::CeilAlign(outLen, UB_BLOCK / MIN_DTYPE_BYTES);` 在函数作用域内无条件计算，但仅在 `if constexpr (Pattern::TailA)` 分支内被引用。当 `!Pattern::TailA` 时，该变量被赋值但从未读取，属于 \"set but not used\"。在开启 `-Wunused-but-set-variable`（GCC）或类似警告且启用 `-Werror` 的编译配置下，这可能导致编译失败。\n\n旧代码中 `inDtypeBlockAlign` 在两个分支中都被使用（`else` 分支中的 `newShape.value[1] = outRepeat * inDtypeBlockAlign;`），不存在此问题。\n\n```suggestion\n        if constexpr (Pattern::TailA) {\n            uint64_t minDtypeBlockAlign = Ops::Base::CeilAlign(outLen, UB_BLOCK / MIN_DTYPE_BYTES);\n            newView.axis[1].srcStride = minDtypeBlockAlign;\n            newShape.value[1] = outRepeat * minDtypeBlockAlign;\n        } else {\n            newView.axis[1].srcStride = outLen;\n            newShape.value[1] = outRepeat * outLen;\n        }\n```\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T09:28:15+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":639,"end_new_line":639,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":177222441,"discussion_id":"0c9e525b9f412e397e92c6c14db30d3cedea7227","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-26T08:42:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T08:42:51+08:00","user":{"id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","login":"Sunee","object_id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","name":"Sunee","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Sunee"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177222515,"discussion_id":"1a5d1e4e491c4fbe06365252ee023db272798f4b","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a h